        {"zh": "快快靠近，别害怕！", "en": "Come closer, don't be afraid!"},
        {"zh": "水中的猎物，唾手可得！", "en": "Prey in the water, within reach!"},
        {"zh": "陆地上的美食，很诱人哦！", "en": "Land prey, very tempting!"},
        {"zh": "水面的波动，是猎物在动！", "en": "The water moves, prey nearby!"},
        {"zh": "我跃出水面，感受自由！", "en": "I leap from the water, feel free!"},
        {"zh": "寻找猎物，它们在我脚下！", "en": "Seeking prey, they are below!"},
        {"zh": "陆地上的声音，危险临近！", "en": "Land sounds, danger near!"},
        {"zh": "捕食，我的本能！", "en": "Prey, my instinct!"}
      ]
    },
    "collide": {
      "operation": "replace",
      "lines": [
